  "text.81c583e62d7d7efabe5f": "GOOG-2023Q4-call",
  "text.d2a167c443c06ba7b133": "已審閱的發行人電話會議未提供",
  "text.04bfeace37e20a99976a": "FY2024 資本支出顯著高於 FY2023；僅屬定性描述。",
  "text.96647138f34dda8b460e": "未提供不等於預測為零；未計算營收命中率。",
  "text.0671f1db0bc09fc75bfa": "GOOG-2024Q1-call",
  "text.23b111c291fc3769f60f": "季度資本支出約等於或高於 Q1 的 ~$12bn；FY2024 營業利益率擴張。",
  "text.35911ed28737656be01b": "GOOG-2024Q2-call",
  "text.231534a75c349038df95": "重申季度支出下限約為 ~$12bn；FY2024 利益率擴張。",
  "text.c0c15f2885f31fecd750": "GOOG-2024Q3-call",
  "text.801a5481d5089169be3f": "Q4 資本支出與 Q3 的 ~$13bn 相近；FY2025 進一步增加。",
  "text.8eeabfb2aa4e7b6918b8": "GOOG-2024Q4-call",
  "text.38e48f847f16a1cb3eed": "FY2025 資本支出 ~$75bn，Q1 為 $16–18bn。",
  "text.fa6c99e1510aec455779": "GOOG-2025Q1-call",
  "text.e4b1caf795fd226a490f": "重申 FY2025 的 ~$75bn；年底產能部署相對較多。",
  "text.7c3d0d9101b39e830a7f": "GOOG-2025Q2-call",
  "text.80cbac6974072853dce6": "FY2025 資本支出修訂為 ~$85bn。",
  "text.bdc02638ffe47335be6e": "GOOG-2025Q3-call",
  "text.a1a5e73bd078a8fda7b6": "FY2025 資本支出修訂為 $91–93bn。",
  "text.6273f884f5e4eb4dcb90": "GOOG-2025Q4-call",
  "text.c30f7654ecefe8b55f57": "FY2026 資本支出為 $175–185bn。",
  "text.1d3b897da9d16eea9fcb": "GOOG-2026Q1-call",
  "text.645f1c7e3076f15a96ad": "因 Intersect，FY2026 資本支出修訂為 $180–190bn；FY2027 顯著增加。",
  "text.60c512de7bf682927343": "GOOG-2026Q2-call",
  "text.57f90c7f71fba9884404": "因加速擴充產能，FY2026 資本支出修訂為 $195–205bn；FY2027 顯著增加。",
  "text.74a1e9352cf9386a3268": "量化預測",
